The following procedure is needed to create and run containers for different users in the same machine:

1) Create a new user as normal

2) Change the value of the viariable USERNAME and VNC_PORT

2.1) The value of USERNAME shoulr be changed to the name of the new user. This must be done in all the .sh scripts:
 - create_image.sh
 - run.sh
 - cmos_docker_run.sh
 
2.2) The VNC_PORT must be a different number for each user. This must be changed in the script cmos_docker_run.sh
 
3) Create an image:

  source create_image.sh
  
4) Create and start a container: 

  source cmos_docker_run.sh
